120,"surface":"魏勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m016-0166","start":166,"end":167,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m016-0168","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m016-0196","start":196,"end":197,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m016-0260","start":260,"end":261,"surface":"勃","kind":"person","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji052-017","person_id":"wse_abc_uqy","title":"中尉","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p010","quote":"齊王既聞此計，乃與其舅父駟鈞、郎中令祝午、中尉魏勃陰謀發兵。齊相召平聞之，乃發卒衛王宮。魏勃紿召平曰：「王欲發兵，非有漢虎符驗也。而相君圍王，固善。勃請為君將兵衛衛王。」召平信之，乃使魏勃將兵圍王宮。勃既將兵，使圍相府。召平曰：「嗟乎！道家之言『當斷不斷，反受其亂』，乃是也。」遂自殺。於是齊王以駟鈞為相，魏勃為將軍，祝午為內史，悉發國中兵。使祝午東詐瑯邪王曰：「呂氏作亂，齊王發兵欲西誅之。齊王自以兒子，年少，不習兵革之事，願舉國委大王。大王自高帝將也，習戰事。齊王不敢離兵，使臣請大王幸之臨菑見齊王計事，并將齊兵以西平關中之亂。」瑯邪王信之，以為然，（西）［迺］馳見齊王。齊王與魏勃等因留瑯邪王，而使祝午盡發瑯邪國而并將其兵。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji052-017:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p010","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"中尉","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m010-0023","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"